{"ID":"20240118151308-p6sgl74","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151308-p6sgl74","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151308-p6sgl74\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151308-p2ryfod\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122094907-skjer6o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122094907-lnsi34n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:330,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:330\u0026#125;","title":"081徐长卿","type":"doc","updated":"20240129164111"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151308-p2ryfod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151308-p2ryfod","updated":"20240122094853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛温，主鬼物百精蛊毒，疫疾邪恶气，温疟，久服强悍轻身。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094856-phu5wu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094856-phu5wu8"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】生山东陕西甘肃，如细辛微粗而长，徐长卿乃人名，尝以此药治邪病，人遂以名之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094858-31s3src","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094858-31s3src"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛性温无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094900-xgclb1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094900-xgclb1v"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】徐长卿主辟邪恶，近时用者不多，功与鬼督邮相近。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094902-q3m254q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094902-q3m254q"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】鬼疰精物邪恶气，杀百虫蛊毒老魅注易，立走啼哭。悲伤恍惚。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094904-pr4nuim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094904-pr4nuim"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通八分至钱半。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094905-r8ei121","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094905-r8ei121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】治鬼之药多有毒。用之宜慎。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094906-yrrx45x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094906-yrrx45x"}},{"ID":"20240122094907-2peg91y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094907-2peg91y"}},{"ID":"20240122094907-lnsi34n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094907-lnsi34n","updated":"20240129164111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第81味药，徐长卿。现在也有很多人用，这个人的名字，他用这个药去治好很多病，结果人家这个药哦叫不出来就叫他的名字，叫徐长卿。中药的名称很好玩，啊那个人只会用这个药来治病，所以他就把这个名字取成他了，这个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"徐长卿，是一个精神科的专用药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，常常这个胡言乱语呀，中邪的样子啊，像前一阵子有一个大陆的导游在中正机场突然发病，衣服一脱光，那个女到处在那边跑来跑去啊，也可以用它。当然经方里面有我们承气汤症，阳明热也会造成这样子，便秘造成的，那你不治好没有关系嘛，你可以常常在大庭广众之下就弃衣而走，衣服一脱就跑，像裸奔一样，实际上是燥热。那这种药呢过去都是用在比如说中邪啦，中毒啦，瘟疫呀，用这个，这个病你只要看到稀奇古怪的，看不懂是什么病，啊我们用徐长卿，啊这个样子，传染性的病都可以用，能够避邪恶啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240122094907-skjer6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094907-skjer6o"}}]}